Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think my dad couldn't\Nhandle being labeled a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom apparently thought\Nhe really did steal it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It made me want to stop believing in people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even thought that maybe I'd feel better\Nif I ended up hating one of my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:28.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But years later, my mom let slip that she\Nregretted not believing him back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized I should\Ncontinue to love them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:41.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I realized that my belief in people\Nwas one of the good things about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw Airi-chan go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Could she still be inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:22.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Airi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:02:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:06.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should never count on a comic artist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going down in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, go out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get Airi-kun mixed up in this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking all the credit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will Airi be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:49.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me he was behind it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He set the fire to try to kill Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it looks like I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airi snuck her phone into my pocket\Nso the police wouldn't see this text.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:12.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means the killer already knew\NAiri's address, or he followed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He might be closer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Either I find him, or I get caught trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this? Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you really are Fujinuma Satoru,\Nthen it's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not here, though. Let's meet somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, I haven't introduced myself yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's save that for when we meet tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you might be the one\Nwho murdered Fujinuma Sachiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:13.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Sawada, formerly of the TV Ishikari city desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. You really are Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you resemble your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:28.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since you're probably wondering:\Nno, I didn't tip off the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't murder your mother, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't suspect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because a mother like her\Nwouldn't have raised a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remembered yesterday that I had it in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has become quite a conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's also partly my fault since I keep screwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:04.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to blame yourself\Nfor something after it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sachiko-san's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I always liked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we talk about what I discussed\Nover the phone with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawada-kun, do you remember the\Nserial murder case from 18 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. Shiratori Jun is on death row,\Nbut he still hasn't admitted his guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru was right about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shiratori-kun didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've realized who the real culprit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's meet at Koiwa Station tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should've asked for a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a past incident I want to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The murder of Hinazuki Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the night of March 2nd, 1988,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:07:01.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo was locked in the shed after being beaten up\Nby her mother and her mother's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She froze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At first, the police suspected the mother\Nand her boyfriend, thinking they'd hid the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in reality, Kayo disappeared from the shed\Nsometime between 10 and 11 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,on the 2nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When her mother noticed she\Nwas gone at 12:30 a.m. on the 3rd,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she called your house and nonchalantly\Ninquired about Kayo's whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was Shiratori Jun who had kidnapped her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One piece of evidence provided was that\Nthe rubber boot prints made near the shed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,matched with boots found at the Shiratori home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The official version of events is as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He knocked her out with\Nblunt force, photographed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and took her to a commercial freezer,\Nwhere he used a spray to speed up her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When her body temperature dropped\Nto 20 degrees, she was brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He then waited 30 minutes\Nto eliminate any chance of survival
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and returned the corpse to the\NHinazuki's shed before sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuuki-san would never do something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:17.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A little before Hinazuki Kayo, \NSugita Hiromi and Nakanishi Aya disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:17.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there were serial kidnapping and\Nmurder cases in the next town over too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The culprit was caught immediately and,\Njust like Shiratori, denied any wrongdoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, if we take your current predicament\Ninto account, do you notice a pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People keep ridiculing me as a crazy reporter\Nwho investigates closed cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in reality, none of these cases are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki Kayo and Sachiko were both killed\Nby a man who frames others for his crimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he's in this city right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's one tricky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By creating additional suspects,\Nhe delays the investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,causing eyewitness testimonies to diminish\Nand the crime scene to deteriorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result, the trail to him goes cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Talk about overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Fujinuma Satoru tried to silence her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to get at her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what about her?\NIs she an accomplice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He forced her to help him kill his mother,\Nand once that was done, he tried to silence her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How awful. I can't believe he dragged\Nthe girl into his mess like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to apologize, Airi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:48.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was all that stalker's fault,\Nnot yours. You must've been so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what happened, Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we didn't notice anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police are searching for the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe they're going after\NSatoru-san for murder and arson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who would believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl got a text from Sachiko-san's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The news said she suffered light injuries,\Nbut she's probably still in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:45.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He tried to help the murder investigation\Nalong by framing you for arson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's partly why,\Nbut I was already the prime suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'd go after her,\NKatagiri Airi, for just that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying she was a target herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:05.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to frame me for my mother's murder,\Nhe needed to know when I'd get home from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He killed her a little more than a day\Nafter she saw his kidnapping attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that time frame, he visited\Nthe restaurant and saw our shift schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Airi must've seen him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He might be someone I know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So he's someone who'd be able to get behind\Nthe counter in a store to look at the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We might be able to use this to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are reports on the murders\Nfrom 18 years ago on my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:46.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I theorize that Shiratori Jun suspects\Nhis own father of being the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that he refuses to provide any alibis\Nor evidence because it may incriminate his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but in turn it makes it worse for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sounds like Yuuki-san, all right. He loved his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:12:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Students from school had seen Hinazuki Kayo\Nand Shiratori Jun together on numerous occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma Satoru's testimony was ignored,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the testimonies of the other students were taken into serious consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A list of suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know any of these names\Naside from Yuuki-san and his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not to mention, there were only five?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police presumed that Sugita Hiromi\Nwas killed after being mistaken for a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result, the police made a list of five suspects\Nwho weren't acquainted with Sugita Hiromi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're doing a folk dance today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hold hands with some ugly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:37.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd much rather have Hiromi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You've got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's now clear why Hiromi was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The culprit was perfectly aware of his gender,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so he killed him to avoid \Nbeing on the list of suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:56.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shiratori Jun was arrested after\Nsomeone in the neighborhood reported
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that he had been talking to\Na third-grade girl who was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Photos taken at the time of Sugita's murder\Nwere found in Shiratori Foods' storeroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the police concluded that\NShiratori Jun had pedophilic tendencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They also seized pedophilic\Nmagazines from his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He never had stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of it was planted by the killer\Nto draw attention away from himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's the list from before Hiromi's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The killer's name must be on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:29.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katagiri, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm here to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But first, is the restroom that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:39.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No vacancies...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,except for room 201.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit! I'm gonna wet myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon my intrusion, Katagiri Airi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're not Fujinuma Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not. I'm Sawada, his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.\NI'm Airi's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way Satoru-san did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He didn't kill his mother.\NHe didn't try to kill me in a fire, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He actually came to save me from the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your manager was the one who saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be confused\Nafter inhaling all that smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you've been told,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:34.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but they think I could be his accomplice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts me so much that nobody believes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But people are even less likely to\Nbelieve Satoru-san, and that hurts me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even now, I still feel like\N I should've gone after your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn! I forgot to turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was still on! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Airi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That aside, can we meet at\Nthe usual place right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you'll get—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all good! I promise I'll come alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.51,0:15:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it actually gonna fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe I actually came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could've just asked her about\Nthe killer over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:52.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll only make things worse for her\Nif she gets involved any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:15:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't fly at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:00.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't it fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doing this gives it what's called "aerodynamic lift."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:09.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will that really make it fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:18.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It flew towards the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's flying too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's he doing at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is he unemployed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did Yuuki-san go through this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I am, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came alone, just like I promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:12.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for worrying that this\Nmight have been a police trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You damn well should be worried about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a fugitive, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm happy you believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The store?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that Nishizono guy is the most suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nishizono?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've seen him a couple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:37.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The manager treats him with respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and from the badge he wears,\Nhe's probably a city councilor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He would've been able to check the schedule,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and it wouldn't be a stretch\Nfor him to know where we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've even exchanged pleasantries with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nishizono?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't see that name\Non the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be an alias?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But surely you can't sit on\Nthe city council using an alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He probably tried to kill me\Nbecause I know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it! It's not coming together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The final piece of the puzzle won't fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-san, I understand how you feel,\Nbut you can't beat yourself up over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have unfinished business from a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.06,0:18:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm talking about a story\Nfor a comic I came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a story about a reaper who makes\Na scheduling error and ends up killing a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He tries desperately to undo his mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the more he tries, the more misfortune \Nhe brings to the people he comes in contact with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He intends to do the right thing, \Nbut everything he does hurts other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean to say he's like you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:46.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that stuff about other people was\Njust the reaper jumping to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think the reaper should have more faith in himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything that's happening\Nright now is just work in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ending is a ways off, \Nand nobody knows how it'll turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so lucky to have met you, Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Fujinuma Satoru, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma Satoru,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:30.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you are under arrest for murder and\Nattempted murder resulting from arson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suspect apprehended at 1650 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?! Satoru didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:43.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way he would have!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew that my relationship with Airi would\Ncease to be, either through arrest or Revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now that time has come.\NI'll never see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's something I have to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Satoru-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:06.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I probably led these people here, \Neven though I promised to come alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to give Airi what I wanted to give her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just like she did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! So sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:18.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...\NIt's all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:22.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What would a superhero say at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it hard to fight all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong, Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because you believed in me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I can keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:44.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:45.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I believed in you.
